Dialogue: 10,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:03.85,0:00:05.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yuuri?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:07.11,0:00:08.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.44,0:00:10.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What happened? I thought you'd be right back.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.15,0:00:12.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Also, where's Yuuri?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.12,0:00:24.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.71,0:00:32.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Did something happen with Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.81,0:00:43.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.27,0:00:48.27,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.19,0:00:51.40,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,it's not "nothing at all".
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.33,0:02:32.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, you got it right. This one too.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.17,0:02:37.80,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Kou and Yuuri...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.80,0:02:40.55,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,What were they doing down there?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.23,0:02:49.52,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,She averted her eyes again!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.52,0:02:53.19,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,What was it? What happened?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.19,0:02:55.65,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Did one of them confess or something?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.78,0:02:59.32,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Or maybe they even k...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.32,0:03:02.16,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,No, stop! Stop thinking about that!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.62,0:03:04.16,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'm a wreck.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.37,0:03:08.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,By the way, how'd you solve this one?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.25,0:03:10.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The way you just told me to.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.33,0:03:14.79,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Could Kou... like Yuuri back?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.29,0:03:19.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me, Kou? \NYou got it down pat right away.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.63,0:03:22.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Do you just not pay attention in class?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.30,0:03:25.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why do you hate studying so much?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.27,0:03:29.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's not so much that I hate it,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.98,0:03:31.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I just feel like it's pointless.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.81,0:03:35.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.23,0:03:39.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I must be an idiot for doing something so pointless.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.40,0:03:41.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,How stupid.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.86,0:03:43.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.37,0:03:47.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If you don't keep up with your studies now,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.83,0:03:50.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,you really will be held back!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.33,0:03:52.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I don't want that to happen!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.17,0:03:56.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Nobody would be happy to see that!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.17,0:03:58.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yuuri...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.47,0:04:07.31,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.31,0:04:09.77,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,What's this tension between them?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.52,0:04:14.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Makita, I didn't know you had such a fire in you!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.23,0:04:17.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're totally right! We all need to move up together. {pass}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.94,0:04:20.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Besides, if you screw up another set of finals,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.53,0:04:23.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,you'll be spending your whole summer doing make-up classes.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.95,0:04:27.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Then we wouldn't be able to all hang out together.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.33,0:04:30.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we should make plans together.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.16,0:04:34.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Could you maybe ask me first?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.33,0:04:37.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's see... any day except Obon works for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.63,0:04:42.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hear that? Let's put in a bit more effort, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.72,0:04:48.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.52,0:04:55.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But I'm too tired for more today.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.10,0:04:56.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.99,0:05:06.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,After all's said and done, we did pretty well.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.36,0:05:08.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're right about that.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.45,0:05:14.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What really surprised me though was when Yuuri got so passionate.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.12,0:05:19.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I guess something really did happen with Kou then?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.76,0:05:25.59,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,That hesitation...{as in gap in conversation}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.59,0:05:27.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.35,0:05:35.06,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...says that it's something she doesn't want me to know.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.61,0:05:40.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.73,0:05:42.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Good work all around.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.02,0:05:43.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye, Futaba-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.69,0:05:44.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.16,0:05:58.08,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I can't let this go!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.80,0:06:08.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kou. Sorry... huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.09,0:06:12.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Were you going somewhere? Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.10,0:06:15.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Not yet. I've still got a bit of time.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.73,0:06:17.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.27,0:06:22.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,A-Actually...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.19,0:06:27.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I think I forgot my cellphone.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.36,0:06:30.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What, really? Wonder if it's in my room.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.28,0:06:33.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll try calling it.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.99,0:06:35.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Come help look.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.29,0:06:43.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Mind if I use your bathroom?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.26,0:06:49.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Can I get a cup of water?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.14,0:06:53.43,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I can't find the right timing.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.47,0:06:58.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So? What did you really come here for?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.81,0:07:01.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You've entertained me enough by now.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.31,0:07:02.98,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,So he knew...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.19,0:07:10.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Well, Kou...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.66,0:07:13.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Did something happen with Yuuri?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.54,0:07:20.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Nothing worth talking about.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.21,0:07:23.04,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,The same hesitation as Yuuri.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.00,0:07:25.96,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,This isn't fair.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.42,0:07:28.51,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Why won't you tell me?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.93,0:07:34.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I just noticed Yuuri was acting strange.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.76,0:07:39.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But Yuuri said nothing happened either...{I don't think context is clear enough}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.89,0:07:43.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If Makita said it was nothing, \Nthen why not believe her?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.31,0:07:46.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's not something you should worry about.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.02,0:07:50.28,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one being left out.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.28,0:07:52.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,There's nothing left to say.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.45,0:07:54.78,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I doubt that. {this connects later}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.12,0:07:57.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,There's also one more thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.79,0:08:03.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I want to know... why you changed.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.46,0:08:08.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What, that again?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.92,0:08:13.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you to stop looking for my past self.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.01,0:08:16.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm not looking.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.01,0:08:19.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm through with looking for who you used to be.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.60,0:08:23.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I want to know who you are right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.77,0:08:26.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I want to know everything you went though.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.61,0:08:34.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.11,0:08:38.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,when someone keeps dodging their questions,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.74,0:08:41.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,most people don't probe any further.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.16,0:08:44.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're pretty incredible.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.17,0:08:46.00,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I see what he's doing.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.00,0:08:49.46,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,He's trying to sarcasm his way out of this.{or "He's trying to use sarcasm to dodge the question."}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.46,0:08:50.96,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But that won't stop me!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.59,0:08:57.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.30,0:08:59.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wait, Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.52,0:09:07.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What'd you do that...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.07,0:09:18.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,My mother.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.03,0:09:22.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that face.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.91,0:09:26.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to hide it or anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.79,0:09:30.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Though even if you knew, I'm not sure you'd be able to say much.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.00,0:09:32.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Besides, I knew
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.80,0:09:35.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,that you would react like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.89,0:09:39.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Makita, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.60,0:09:44.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,She reacted the exact same way you did.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.69,0:09:55.40,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,When Yuuri found out about Kou's mom
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.11,0:10:01.91,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,she must've found it impossible to talk about.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.91,0:10:03.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.04,0:10:08.83,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,And here I am...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.42,0:10:13.13,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...doubting every little thing about them.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.84,0:10:20.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.97,0:10:23.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why are you apologizing?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.35,0:10:26.85,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Both Kou and Yuuri
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.10,0:10:31.73,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,were trying to be sensitive to other people's feelings.{as in, Kou was thinking about [Yuuri + rest of them] and Yuuri was thinking about [Kou + rest of them]}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.23,0:10:39.20,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But all I think about is myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.82,0:10:42.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're such a crybaby.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.83,0:10:44.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's enough.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.62,0:10:48.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.38,0:11:00.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You don't know when to quit.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.06,0:11:15.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You won't... drop out, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.45,0:11:26.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou, don't you want to be with us?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.04,0:11:30.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Because I...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.04,0:11:36.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,...I want to be with you!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.92,0:12:23.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.06,0:12:30.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, stop that...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.60,0:12:33.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You've got the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.98,0:12:37.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I told her about Mom and she started crying.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.24,0:12:47.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.20,0:12:51.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Whoops, I need to get going.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.50,0:12:57.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Where are you going? Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.88,0:12:59.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I've got work today.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.71,0:13:00.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Work?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.51,0:13:06.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What, today's a work day? \NWant me to give you a ride?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.39,0:13:07.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.81,0:13:11.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Take her home instead.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.14,0:13:15.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,W-Wait...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.75,0:13:37.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What am I doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.84,0:13:46.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Tanaka-sensei, are you on bad terms with Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.60,0:13:57.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou probably can't forgive me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.44,0:14:01.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It started when our parents divorced.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.69,0:14:07.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou, I'll leave Mom in your hands.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.16,0:14:09.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.83,0:14:21.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,As I said that, I left all the hard work to Kou
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.92,0:14:24.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,when we needed each other the most.{I am dissatisfied with this line but cannot come up with an alternative that is not horribly horrible like "when the going was the roughest" or "when things were the worst"}{I knew you wouldn't}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.18,0:14:30.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Right turn here?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.84,0:14:31.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.23,0:14:47.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,When our mother fell ill and was admitted to the hospital,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.28,0:14:55.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I had just started my teaching job.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.87,0:15:03.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I couldn't visit the hospital she was \Ntransferred to in Nagasaki very often. {it's in Nagasaki, not them, right?}{yes}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.39,0:15:24.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It pained me to see my mother growing thinner every time I saw her.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.86,0:15:33.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I was always scared to step inside her room.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.95,0:15:38.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Really, really scared.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.21,0:15:42.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But I left him alone
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.08,0:15:47.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,to experience that day after day.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.68,0:15:58.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou's actually a really nice and kind boy. That's why—
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.14,0:15:59.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.32,0:16:07.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.20,0:16:12.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Isn't he?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.70,0:16:17.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He's a good kid.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.00,0:16:22.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.97,0:16:42.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The more things you view as precious, the more they weigh you down.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.11,0:16:51.69,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Those were the words of someone who knows the fear of loss.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.24,0:16:59.24,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,That's why Kou became the person he is.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.58,0:17:03.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.42,0:17:15.55,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,You've been walking through a night
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.47,0:17:18.97,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I didn't know about.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.60,0:17:24.69,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.77,0:17:32.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But I'm too tired for more today.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.23,0:17:33.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.15,0:17:34.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.86,0:17:36.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Take her home instead.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.16,0:17:40.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,W-Wait...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.29,0:17:44.37,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But Kou,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.37,0:17:49.50,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I know that's not all.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.34,0:17:54.51,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,No matter how abrasive or blunt you may act,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.09,0:18:01.72,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I know that down inside, you're kind.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.27,0:18:11.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.99,0:18:17.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba-chan, what happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.49,0:18:19.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why are you apologizing?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.37,0:18:25.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I made Kou tell me about his mother.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.29,0:18:31.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You didn't know whether it was alright to tell me,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.84,0:18:34.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,so you said it was nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.67,0:18:38.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But while you were worrying,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.88,0:18:42.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I got jealous... I'm so pathetic.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.85,0:18:47.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No, you're not...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.43,0:18:49.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm the same.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.35,0:18:55.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Every time I see you and Mabuchi-kun joking around,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.40,0:18:59.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,it feels like you're getting ahead of me. {I'm at a disadvantage}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.24,0:19:01.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I get really uneasy.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.54,0:19:10.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who said no hard feelings no matter who wins, {it was originally no getting angry}{this sentence feels wonky}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.46,0:19:16.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,but I always get jealous, and I always feel uneasy.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.17,0:19:23.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Part of the reason I didn't tell you about Mabuchi-kun's mom
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.22,0:19:29.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,was that I wanted to have a secret with him you didn't. {oops}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.06,0:19:37.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It hurts hearing you apologize to me like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.40,0:19:39.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.66,0:19:50.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Doesn't this suck?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.33,0:19:56.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why did we have to fall in love with the same person?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.68,0:20:03.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I've had enough!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.68,0:20:06.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.27,0:20:13.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But Yuuri, just know that I love you!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.90,0:20:20.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I love you too, Futaba-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.67,0:20:39.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's head back.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.92,0:20:42.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.14,0:20:52.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So, what's this?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.94,0:20:57.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,A special edition of my easy-to-understand math notes.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.52,0:21:00.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Take them. No need for thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.23,0:21:03.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Aren't I just the nicest?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.03,0:21:04.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Take it back.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.86,0:21:07.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, how hard do you think I worked to make that?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.24,0:21:10.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're getting pretty offended for doing something I didn't ask for.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.99,0:21:12.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Say that again?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.37,0:21:17.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So that's how you treat favors. Oh, I see how it is.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.17,0:21:17.04,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You see?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.96,0:21:23.05,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Even when you act abrasive, that's how you show your kindness. {I switched blunt/abrasive}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.01,0:21:27.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll write you one for chemistry, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.05,0:21:29.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, that'd be great.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.22,0:21:31.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,When are we having our next study session?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.77,0:21:33.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Mabuchi-kun, when are you free?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.68,0:21:36.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We can even have dinner next time.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.56,0:21:40.11,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,If Kou still feels the need to walk around at night,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.56,0:21:40.11,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,I'll whip up my specialty for you!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:41.02,0:21:44.53,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,then we'll just have to be the light that guides him out.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.53,0:21:46.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That sounds gross.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:51.28,0:21:53.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.00,0:23:40.02,next time,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HDFB045&\bord3\blur3\3c&HE3B43C&\pos(219.429,138.571)}NEXT TIME...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:25.00,0:23:40.02,next time,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.5\c&HFFFEF9&\pos(219.429,138.571)}NEXT TIME...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:29.01,0:23:30.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's too late!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:32.64,0:23:38.18,AoHaru,,40,0,0,,If you really feel scared, then that\N means you see us as precious!
